# Bot1 has Captain Mar-Vell, Space-Born, so once an opponent has cast a spell this turn Bot1 may cast spells as though they
# had flash. On Bot2's turn 4 Bot2 takes Bot1's Firestorm Phoenix with Control Magic and kills it with Lightning Bolt: it
# returns to its owner's hand, and "that player", who can't play it until their next turn, is its owner Bot1 - not Bot2, who
# controlled it (CR 101.2, 701.18b). So Bot1 can't cast it then, flash and mana to spare notwithstanding; on their own turn 5
# they may.

[Bot1 Deck]
Firestorm Phoenix
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mountain
Captain Mar-Vell, Space-Born
Plains
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Control Magic
Lightning Bolt
Island
Island
Island x20

